      "last": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 668,
        "text": "In Germany, they came first for the Communists, but I didn't speak up because I wasn't a Communist. Then they came for the Jews, and I didn't speak up because I wasn't a Jew. Then they came for the trade unionists, and I didn't speak up because I wasn't a trade unionist."
